Now I understand the gate:
- `_check_negative_claims`: if opinion text contains any of the strong negative words (不存在/未备份/未同步/确认缺失/缺失/卡住/丢失/死锁) OR matches pattern, it must contain `**存在性核查**` literal. Otherwise block.
- `_check_review_record`: needs `## 终审记录` section ≥50 chars.

So when I write my 终审记录, I must:
1. Have a `## 终审记录` section ≥50 chars.
2. If I use negative claim words like "未同步", "缺失", "丢失", etc., I must include literal `**存在性核查**`.

